# Local-only secrets for `npm run dev`. Copy to `.dev.vars`, which is gitignored.
# In production set these with `npx wrangler secret put NAME` instead.

# Optional. Without it the commute tile stays on a labelled typical fallback
# and never calls the routing API.
GOOGLE_ROUTES_API_KEY=

# Strongly recommended in production. CoinGecko's keyless tier is limited per
# source IP, and a Worker egresses from shared Cloudflare datacenter ranges --
# so it 429s in practice regardless of how little this board asks for.
# Use a free *Demo* key: this code sends x-cg-demo-api-key to api.coingecko.com.
# A paid Pro key needs a different host and header and will 400 here.
COINGECKO_API_KEY=
